// Tests for core/textrun (scope AB). Every test font is built here from code (no font file). Expected values come from an
// independent Python reference (tools/textrun_ref.py: its own font builder, UTF-8 decoder, format 4 lookup, advance lookup, pen
// rounding and FNV) and are pasted below as constants; the C++ font builder is checked against the reference builder by byte
// digests. Hand-computed values and overlap layouts are derived from textrun.h. Evidence label: local unit tests only.
